# Rename this file to "apikey.txt" and put it next to TodoSnap.exe to enable
# the online Vision mode. When present, TodoSnap tries the API first and falls
# back to offline Windows OCR on any error or timeout (5s). Delete it to stay
# fully offline.
#
# Line 1 (required): your API key
# Line 2 (optional): endpoint URL   (default: https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions)
# Line 3 (optional): model name     (default: gpt-4o-mini)
#
# NOTE: lines starting with '#' are NOT supported by the parser — the real
# apikey.txt must contain ONLY the values, e.g.:
#
# sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
# gpt-4o-mini
